# Majorana modes, the half-fermions that store a qubit non-locally. A Majorana operator is its own antiparticle, squaring
# to one and equal to its own conjugate, and it takes TWO of them to build one ordinary fermion, so a chain of N sites
# carries two N Majoranas making N fermions. In Kitaev's chain the topological phase leaves one unpaired Majorana at each
# end, and the two ends together form a single fermion whose occupation is a protected qubit: the ground state is two-fold
# degenerate and the information is stored in the pair of distant ends, immune to any local noise. Braiding these end modes
# realizes the Ising anyons, whose quantum dimension is the square root of two, so the Ising theory has three objects, the
# vacuum, the Majorana fermion and the sigma anyon, with total quantum dimension squared one plus two plus one, four. This
# file checks the two-Majoranas-per-fermion count, the ground-state degeneracy, the fusion of two sigmas, and the Ising
# total quantum dimension.

# Two Majoranas make one fermion: a chain of 6 sites carries 2 * 6 = 12 Majorana operators forming 6 fermions.
hold two-majoranas-per-fermion
  call is-equal
    code 12
    call multiply
      code 2
      code 6

# The topological phase has one unpaired Majorana at each of the two ends, and the two together make one fermion carrying
# a protected qubit, so the ground state is two-fold degenerate: 2 ends make 1 fermion, 2 = 1 + 1 states.
hold ground-state-is-two-fold-degenerate
  call is-equal
    code 2
    call add
      code 1
      code 1

# Two sigma anyons fuse two ways, to the vacuum or to the Majorana fermion: sigma times sigma is 1 + psi, two outcomes.
hold two-sigmas-fuse-two-ways
  call is-equal
    code 2
    call add
      code 1
      code 1

# The Ising theory has three objects with total quantum dimension squared one plus two plus one: the vacuum and the
# fermion each contribute one, the sigma contributes its quantum dimension squared two, summing to 1 + 2 + 1 = 4, so the
# total quantum dimension is two.
hold ising-total-quantum-dimension-squared-is-four
  call is-equal
    code 4
    call add
      code 1
      call add
        code 2
        code 1
